朝見，曰：「君有疾在腠理，不治將深。」桓侯曰：「寡人無疾。」扁鵲出，桓侯謂左右曰：「醫之好利也，欲以不疾者為功。」後五日，扁鵲復見，曰：「君有疾在血脈，不治恐深。」桓侯曰：「寡人無疾。」扁鵲出，桓侯不悅。後五日，扁鵲復見，曰；「君有疾在腸胃閒，不治將深。」桓侯不應。扁鵲出，桓侯不悅。後五日，扁鵲復見，望見桓侯而退走。桓侯使人問其故。扁鵲曰：「疾之居腠理也，湯熨之所及也；在血脈，鍼石之所及也；其在腸胃，酒醪之所及也；其在骨髓，雖司命無柰之何。今在骨髓，臣是以無請也。」後五日，桓侯體病，使人召扁鵲，扁鵲已逃去。桓侯遂死。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0268"}],"interpretation_note":"保存來源所敘實際死亡，不把預期病程或醫理泛論當死亡；未明年不推卒年，不由死亡自動終止全部官爵。 齊桓侯依古注暫指田午，注家對年代的疑問保留，不以病例排定絕對年。 未核書影。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"桓公午","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p024","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"桓公午","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p024","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p024","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p024","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m025-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p025","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"齊桓侯","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"桓侯","kind":"person","per