unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"騶忌","kind":"person","person_id":"drb_gcn_28e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0068","start":68,"end":71,"surface":"段干朋","kind":"person","person_id":"29i_iqg_x15","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0092","start":92,"end":95,"surface":"田臣思","kind":"person","person_id":"s63_f1q_qe0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m024-0138","start":138,"end":141,"surface":"韓使者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p025","text":"六年，救衞。桓公卒，子威王因齊立。是歳，故齊康公卒，絶無後，奉邑皆入田氏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m025-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m025-0011","start":11,"end":15,"surface":"威王因齊","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m025-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"齊康公","kind":"person","person_id":"zwr_jel_e3l_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m025-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"田氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p007","text":"扁鵲過齊，齊桓侯客之。入朝見，曰：「君有疾在腠理，不治將深。」桓侯曰：「寡人無疾。」扁鵲出，桓侯謂左右曰：「醫之好利也，欲以不疾者為功。」後五日，扁鵲復見，曰：「君有疾在血脈，不治恐深。」桓侯曰：「寡人無疾。」扁鵲出，桓侯不悅。後五日，扁鵲復見，曰；「君有疾在腸胃閒，不治將深。」桓侯不應。扁鵲出，桓侯不悅。後五日，扁鵲復見，望見桓侯而退走。桓侯使人問其故。扁鵲曰：「疾之居腠理也，湯熨之所及也；在血脈，鍼石之所及也；其在腸胃，酒醪之所及也；其在骨髓，雖司命無柰之何。今在骨髓，臣是以無請也。」後五日，桓侯體病，使人召扁鵲，扁鵲已逃去。桓侯遂死。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"扁鵲","kind":"person","person_id":"6hq_bb2_3rb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"齊桓侯","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"桓侯","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"扁鵲","kind":"person","person_id":"6hq_bb2_3rb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"桓侯","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"扁鵲","kind":"person","person_id":"6hq_bb2_3rb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"桓侯","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"扁鵲","kind":"person","person_id":"6hq_bb2_3rb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"桓侯","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"扁鵲","kind":"person","person_id":"6hq_bb2_3rb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m007-0140","start":140,"end":142,"surface":"桓侯","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA"